  "Each condition is checked at start time. When it is not met you choose what happens: skip the run, or water less (run at the chosen % of the normal time — it only shortens, so it never clashes with other groups). Unavailable data never blocks watering. For soil: pick your moisture sensor(s), set ≤ your target % (several sensors are combined, average by default), then choose skip above that, or water less to just cut the run short. A soil trigger can still water the zone if it dries out before the next scheduled run.": "每个条件都在启动时检查。若不满足，您可选择跳过本次运行，或减少浇水量（按设定的百分比缩短正常时长——仅缩短，因此不会与其他组冲突）。数据不可用不会阻止浇水。对于土壤：选择湿度传感器，设置 ≤ 目标百分比（多个传感器默认取平均值），然后选择超过该值时跳过，或减少浇水以缩短运行时间。若土壤在下次计划运行前变干，土壤触发器仍可浇水。",
